       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 WS-TAX    PIC 9(7)V99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM COMPUTE-TAX.
           PERFORM WRITE-REPORT.
           STOP RUN.
       COMPUTE-TAX.
           COMPUTE WS-TAX = WS-AMOUNT * 0.10.
       WRITE-REPORT.
           DISPLAY "TAX: " WS-TAX.
